                "id": "RH_V1t"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Anywho, I've yet to completely make sense of all these notes. Some must have been placed elsewhere."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Maybe that loathsome vampyre wandering about knows something?"
              },
              {
                "player": "The one roaming around lighting candles? He doesn't seem totally with it."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Hmm, you might be right. He'll be of no use..."
